# Safe: read-only dependency checks.
Output docs/media/check.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 20
Set Columns 120
Set Rows 30
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set WaitTimeout 15s

Type "bin/kdeploy check"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Dependency checks/
Sleep 2s
